{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong>Don\u2019t Press</strong> to your Wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t Press</strong> is a 2D game with levels that range from short and intense to long and challenging, where each stage introduces a new mechanic and a different type of challenge.<br>You control a small square using <strong>WASD</strong> \u2014 use <strong>Shift</strong> to run, dodge traps, solve puzzles, and find the right button to move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level completely changes the gameplay style: some are fast and reaction-based, others are slower and focused on logic.<br>With every new challenge, the game reinvents itself, always keeping the sense of discovery alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Don\u2019t Press</strong>, every mistake teaches you something new. Curiosity is your greatest ally \u2014 and also your greatest danger.<br>The goal is simple \u2014 but not always safe: <strong>press the right button.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4106560?t=1768185500","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4106560?t=1768185500","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106560/b7ea55a9f4ef7c9e69c553b162402703c1beb9a3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768185500","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106560/b7ea55a9f4ef7c9e69c553b162402703c1beb9a3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768185500","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong>Don\u2019t Press</strong> to your Wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t Press</strong> is a 2D game with levels that range from short and intense to long and challenging, where each stage introduces a new mechanic and a different type of challenge.<br>You control a small square using <strong>WASD</strong> \u2014 use <strong>Shift</strong> to run, dodge traps, solve puzzles, and find the right button to move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level completely changes the gameplay style: some are fast and reaction-based, others are slower and focused on logic.<br>With every new challenge, the game reinvents itself, always keeping the sense of discovery alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Don\u2019t Press</strong>, every mistake teaches you something new. Curiosity is your greatest ally \u2014 and also your greatest danger.<br>The goal is simple \u2014 but not always safe: <strong>press the right button.</strong></p>","developers":["V3K Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106560/9bd061e8d1ff0a99f45d61add72398c8a6a24168/header.jpg?t=1768185500","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4106560/2082706409/90ca4ebf5bd75b47776305aaae02c60fb247cbb0/1762462831/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762463355","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4106560/2082706409/90ca4ebf5bd75b47776305aaae02c60fb247cbb0/1762462831/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762463355","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4106560/2082706409/90ca4ebf5bd75b47776305aaae02c60fb247cbb0/1762462831/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762463355","id":257227948,"name":"Dont Press","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257227948/24c4b3d362282b22e9e4aeefdcdcf0966099cc0b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762463355"}],"name":"Don't Press","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><stro